   "name": "RainCloud",
   "description": "A SoundCloud client for KaiOS. - Some things to know 1 - Right Soft Key (RSK) while a list item is selected will open its context menu, where you can choose to play. 2 - Left Soft Key (LSK) opens the app menu. 3 - With the player open, Left will skip back 10 seconds, Right will skip forward 30 seconds, while Up and Down control volume. - How to use 1 - On your computer, visit the RainCloud website to sign into SoundCloud. 2 - In the app, select 'Sign In via QR Code' and scan the code on your screen. *You may have to exit and reopen the app to scan the code after giving permission. 3 - When you scan the code, you're in!",
